Business Function
DBSI T&O is the backbone that supports the bank as the central of operations and technology. With the spirit of OneTeam and PRIDE! Value, we serve Institutional Banking Operations and Consumer Banking Operations, manage Customer Centre and IT, provide Group Procurement and Corporate Real Estate, coordinate bank-wide Business Continuity Management program and framework, and deliver service quality for Digibank and IBG/GTS. Our Technology & Operations organization is a vital strategic partner to the business in providing competitive advantage that propels DBSI towards being the Best Bank for a Better World (#B3W).
Job Responsibilities
Manage the Bank's information and cybersecurity strategy implementation, including related policies, standards, and guidelines, to align with business and operational goals;
Ensuring the Group’s information and cybersecurity risk management program is in compliance with regulatory requirements and industry best practice;
Conducting information and cybersecurity training and awareness;
Support execution of DLP strategies and initiatives according to the DLP roadmap;
Investigate and escalate DLP incidents in accordance with the DLP incident response and handling procedures;
Conduct evaluations of the cybersecurity control environment to identify gaps and implement continuous improvement measures.
Assessing deviations from the policies, standards and guidelines raised by the BUs and SUs;
Maintaining appropriate contacts with the regulators and industry bodies for cybersecurity matters and information sharing, including cybersecurity incident notification and updates;
Provides advisory reviews for projects, ensuring that new systems and initiatives integrate security by design
Provide consultation related to cyber security such as risk issues, including identifying potential business/operational impact, severity of risks, and recommending mitigating controls and remediation plans.
Location:
Jakarta Head Office
Job:
Technology
Schedule:
Regular
Employee Status:
Full time

